{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive a Deadly Night</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in a filmed deadly duel where money isn\u2019t the ultimate stake. Uncover a story that won\u2019t end along with your failures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/d2d667e85c6be59c5e2475dd7bd85b57.poster.avif?t=1768918427\" width=780 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/d2d667e85c6be59c5e2475dd7bd85b57.webm?t=1768918427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/d2d667e85c6be59c5e2475dd7bd85b57.mp4?t=1768918427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Load It Yourself</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have the chance to choose the placement of the cartridges in the revolver\u2019s cylinder yourself. Remember the current position, control the game \u2014 your strategy becomes a weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/f7bd298351317c0476f27ba8cc456466.poster.avif?t=1768918427\" width=780 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/f7bd298351317c0476f27ba8cc456466.webm?t=1768918427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/f7bd298351317c0476f27ba8cc456466.mp4?t=1768918427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Turn the Game on Its Head</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the direct and alternative abilities of the game cards to change the course of play and confuse your opponent. Everything can change at any moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/7734fbe4856fb79632b702b05ed7d318.poster.avif?t=1768918427\" width=780 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/7734fbe4856fb79632b702b05ed7d318.webm?t=1768918427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/7734fbe4856fb79632b702b05ed7d318.mp4?t=1768918427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Express emotions.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get angry, provoke, joke, admire. Don\u2019t hold yourself back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/293e0308f1bd267b44525271c2762c91.poster.avif?t=1768918427\" width=780 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/293e0308f1bd267b44525271c2762c91.webm?t=1768918427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009840/extras/293e0308f1bd267b44525271c2762c91.mp4?t=1768918427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every Player for Themselves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the risk of a three-player game where every shot reshuffles relationships between players, breaking old alliances and creating new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009840?t=1768918427","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009840?t=1768918427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/